<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>But He who firmly attaches us with you</l><l>To Christ, and has anointed us</l><l>Is God, who has sealed us and has given the pledge</l><l>Of the Spirit in our hearts.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
